<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-xiue" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6403030); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6403030&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607588968" alt="Dr_xiue" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6403030)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-xiue" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6403030); return false;">Dr_xiue</a></span></p>
